    "causal_summary": "The home for deliberate, operator-requested UX and visual changes to the shipped Svelte app — the first packet in this program allowed to change a rendered value. The migration children and the 007-EXT quality pass are bound by a hard zero-rendered-change invariant, so a request like 'make the scroll-to-latest control glass' has nowhere else to live. Each change is opt-in, individually scoped, and must still honour the frozen --pi-* token set, the a11y contracts and the security posture.",
